      "offsetInSection": 5028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quiero que me enseñes un Pokémon alfa.\n¡Por favor te lo pido!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006900650072006F00200071007500650020006D006500200065006E0073006500F10065007300200075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200061006C00660061002E000A00A10050006F00720020006600610076006F00720020007400650020006C006F0020007000690064006F002100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que <U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+000B>, ¿eh? ¡Impresionante!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEstos Pokémon que me has mostrado son tal y\ncomo me los imaginaba. ¡Muchas gracias!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Veamos qué tal te parece el romance que tengo\nen mente...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005600650061006D006F007300200071007500E9002000740061006C002000740065002000700061007200650063006500200065006C00200072006F006D0061006E006300650020007100750065002000740065006E0067006F000A0065006E0020006D0065006E00740065002E002E002E00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002> ama a <U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
